sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant ST as SettingsTab
    participant J as app_settings.json
    participant RF as RecordFlow
    U->>ST: change video quality
    ST->>J: save() + "✓ Saved"
    Note over J: one JSON file in<br/>the config directory
    U->>RF: start a new recording
    RF->>J: load()
    J-->>RF: resolution + bitrate
    RF->>RF: recorder uses new quality
